<title>FRANCE: Tunisia seeks 150,000 tonnes U.S. wheat - traders.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 150,000 tonnes U.S. wheat - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has launched a tender for Friday to purchase 150,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat, European grain traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment in six lots of 25,000 tonnes each in August, September and October, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
